    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "TOM MAHER & COMPANY SCSI RICS IPAV - This attractive 3 bed mid terraced home is enviably located in a quiet cu de sac setting with immediate pedestrian access to the N81 and Lucan link Road, adjacent to a large open green space which enjoys panoramic views of the Dublin Mountains perfect for family living. A warm and inviting home boasting light-filled accommodation, part updated, well maintained, the property offers a wealth of opportunity for the discerning purchaser to create their own dream home with style and flair by adding the finishing touch. NO ONWARD CHAIN. Located just in off the N81 within a short commute of the M50 and N7 in this mature residential convenient and highly popular residential estate which enjoys ease of access to a wide range of services and amenities both social and essential. An outstanding opportunity for first time buyers looking to get on the property ladder to acquire this lovingly cared for home. Early viewing is highly advised in order to avoid disappointment REGISTER YOUR INTEREST BY EMAIL."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance porch with tiled flooring to the hallway with quality wood flooring, guest wc with whb, fully tiled, separate cloakroom\r\nLounge : 3.51m x 4.18m feature tiled fireplace, wood flooring\r\nKitchen/dining room : 5.43m x 2.56m neat arrangement of units and presses, divider counter providing additional storage, tiled splash area, quality wood flooring, part tiled flooring, patio doors lead to the rear garden\r\nUPSTAIRS\r\nBathroom : Shower wth Triton T90Z electric shower , whb with storage, wc -  chrome heated towel rail, The floor and wall areas are fully tiled.\r\nBedroom 1 : 3.51m x 3.54m wall to wall wardrobes incorporating vanity unit with drawers, wood flooring\r\nHot press\r\nBedroom 2 : 3.51m x 3.91m wood flooring\r\nBedroom 3 : 2.91m x 2.34m built in wardrobe plus vanity unit with drawers, wood flooring"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Single aluminum glazing\r\nPVC fascia and soffit\r\nGas fired radiator central heating ( Glow worm boiler)\r\nTrip switch fuse board\r\n2 of the bedrooms have built in wardrobes\r\nAttic with pull down ladder\r\nFreehold Title\r\nWalled garden to the front, cobbled driveway providing excellent off street car parking\r\nWalled private garden to the rear, not overlooking\r\nBock utility shed"
      },
